    {
      "id": "blk_31d90fb4",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "桑古伊斯狩原是七丘对抗黑潮的前沿阵地。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_df1d6b48",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "由于地形特殊，狩原常年回音能量聚涌，自黎那汐塔第一次黑潮爆发以来，在异常地貌的加持下，狩原上空始终盘踞着一片无法散去的黑潮云。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_2af9fd61",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "每逢黑潮涨潮期，无数七丘角斗士便聚集在此，狩猎黑潮造物，追逐荣誉。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    }
  ]
